== Theatre of Blood (Normal Mode) ==

=== Learner ===
Gear setups at this stage look largely identical. 

* Aside from freezers bringing additional magic switches, all roles benefit from both BGS and DWH, but the Melee and Range roles usually have more inventory space to comfortably bring both. 
* If you have access to a [[Scythe of vitur]] or [[Twisted bow]], bring them in addition to these setups by replacing a brew or food.
* Melee and range roles can bring the [[Arceuus spellbook]] and a [[Book of the dead]] for [[Thrall|Thralls]] or the [[Lunar spellbook]] for [[Vengeance]] and [[Boost Potion Share|Potion Share]].

