=== Standard ===
As you gain experience with the raid, you will naturally use less supplies and can bring additional gear. Until you acquire a [[Scythe of vitur]], strength gear is a relatively small improvement for the amount of inventory it uses.   

* All roles can bring their role specific gear and 4 special attack weapons, [[Bandos godsword]], [[Dragon warhammer]], [[Dragon claws]], and [[Crystal halberd]].
* An Osmumten's fang for Sotetseg and phase 3 Verzik (without a Scythe)
* Freeze roles should bring a Magic damage % staff for [[Ice Barrage]] and a form of Magic boost.
* Melee roles should bring a faster or multi-hit weapon for Nylocas
* Range roles should bring Chinchompas and a ranged off-hand for Nylocas in their room and for [[Nylocas Matomenos]] clumps.

