=== Advanced ===
Once you are very comfortable with supplies and stronger equipment, the gap between void and strength equipment begins to widen and you should consider bringing more gear into the raid.  

* Substitute your [[Void melee helm]] for a melee helm, top, legs, and gloves.
* Additional role gear, special attack weapons, and Elite void range are all still valuable additions.
* [[Guthix rest]] and [[Phoenix necklace|Phoenix necklaces]] can provide additional survivability for Bloat and Sotetseg.

