=== Efficient ===
With coordinated teams and few mistakes, nearly the entire raid can be completed with minimal supplies until Verzik. Purchase prayer potions, super restores, and sharks as needed after Bloat. Purchase Verzik supplies after Sotetseg. After supplies are used in the raid, you have enough room to bring at least 3 Saradomin brews and 2 Super restores into Verzik.

* Non-freezers can fit additional runes to perform [[Spellbook Swap]] on the [[Lunar spellbook]] with Blood, Soul, Cosmic, Astral, Death, Lava, and Law runes to continuously cast [[Vengeance]], [[Resurrection spells]], and [[Death Charge]]. [[Aether rune|Aether runes]] save an additional inventory slot. 
* All roles can bring a 1-dose [[Divine ranging potion]] for nylocas.

* With a Dizana's quiver a [[Zaryte crossbow]] and [[Ruby dragon bolts (e)]] can be added to any role as a more powerful special attack weapon. However, this requires close attention to your special attack meter with assistance of a [[Lightbearer]] or [[Surge potion|surge potions]] in order to get multiple special attacks per boss.
* A [[Dinh's bulwark]] on the melee role can deal exceptional damage to most [[Nylocas Matomenos]] if stacked. This is most helpful in 4's and 5's.
* The [[Tonalztics of ralos]] can lower [[The Maiden of Sugadinti|Maiden's]] defence much more consistently than a [[Bandos godsword]], saving special attacks for stacking and skipping.

