== Theatre of Blood (Hard Mode) ==
There are few fundamental differences between Hard mode and Normal mode, but less supplies are given, mistakes are more punishing, and mechanics require more planning and coordination. Generally, hard mode is best started after becoming very familiar with the raid and becoming very comfortable bringing minimal supplies.

=== Minimum / Void ===
Hard mode is generally considered worse profit compared to normal mode due to the more challenging mechanics and extra time spent in the raid. Gear upgrades, especially mega rare weapons, can significantly improve damage output and improve raid consistency, (which is especially important considering the time requirements). Despite this, raids in these setups are still able to be completed within the raid timer with proficient gameplay and minimal mistakes.  

* Sanfew serums can be brought to remove the poison from Verzik's attack in P2.
* Substitute additional special attack weapons for supplies if needed.

