=== Standard ===
These setups come equipped with most endgame gear while balancing additional supplies to account for mistakes. Substitutions can be made to fit additional supplies if necessary, such as:

* Bringing Saradomin brews and Super restores instead of Anglerfish, Guthix rests, and Phoenix necklaces.
* Only bringing either Dragon warhammer or Bandos godsword, ensuring the rest of the team coordinates special attacks.
* Only bringing either Crystal halberd or Dragon claws
* Dropping Elite void or additional range gear for non-range roles. 
* Using a Serpentine helmet instead of a Blowpipe to poison the purple nylocas in Verzik
* Forgotten brew or other magic potion instead of bringing an Imbued or Saturated heart.

