=== Efficient ===
Hard mode efficient setups are very similar to efficient Normal mode setups with the addition of 1 or 2 more supplies. Completing the raid with this few of supplies requires careful coordination and minimal mistakes, but can complete raids significantly faster by:

* Stacking nylocas at Maiden with the help of Tonalztics of ralos, Zaryte crossbows, and Dihn's bulwarks
* Consistently defeating bloat on the 2nd down
* Utilizing Vengeance and Thralls on both Melee and Range roles.
* Using surge potions for additional special attacks at Maiden, Nylocas, and Verzik.

